Package: com.wmua1.myjb.checkm8
Name: myJB Loader (checkm8)
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: myJB container loader (checkm8/palera1n)
 Installs myjb_loader.dylib into ElleKit's TweakInject directory so that
 .myjb containers are decrypted and loaded in every process. Creates the
 container/staging directories and generates the device key (kdev).
 Respring after installing.
Maintainer: wmua1
Author: wmua1
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Tag: purpose::extension
